                                "example_id": "c81d0d9c-3998-4347-8429-c3e8def75982",
                                "sense_id": "0889dd2e-abbd-36e1-a65b-315ef3d2218f",
                                "text": "At one of the dim cross-roads they had made a misturn, and were now wandering around without the slightest notion of where they were going."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a4d00ae-e0ce-4a14-8985-6ffd6d65a877",
                                "sense_id": "0889dd2e-abbd-36e1-a65b-315ef3d2218f",
                                "text": "They heroically struggled through the remainder of the figure, but Oh-Pshaw, completely demoralized, made one misturn after the other."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
